  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 203.02 Public Participation in Non-Adjudicative Hearings. Any person may participate in a non-adjudicative hearing while the hearing record is open by:\n\n(a) Testifying orally;\n\n(b) Submitting written testimony pursuant to Env-C 205.06;\n\n(c) Submitting written or oral questions through the presiding officer; or\n\n(d) Any combination of (a) through (c), above.\n\nSource. #1710, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss and moved by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95 (formerly Env-A 204.02); EXPIRED: 6-30-03\n\nNew. #8128, eff 7-28-04; ss by 10187, eff 9-25-12; ss by #13491, eff 11-19-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a200.html"
